nd provides APIs to frontend\"\necho \"• Roop (Frontend) - Implements designs and integrates with backend APIs\"\necho \"• Gati (Performance) - Monitors and optimizes all agent outputs\"\necho \"• Dhar (QA/DevOps) - Tests everything and manages deployment coordination\"\necho \"\"\necho \"The agents can now work together on complex projects with:\"\necho \"✅ Sequential handoffs (Pal → Kalp → Kosh → Mool → Roop)\"\necho \"✅ Parallel coordination (Security, Performance, QA across all)\"\necho \"✅ Feedback loops (Optimization and quality improvements)\"\necho \"✅ Conflict resolution (Architecture-led decision making)\"\necho \"✅ Quality gates (Automatic blocking when standards not met)\"",
