       # 🔄 REAL-TIME COORDINATION\n    ├── redis-queues/           # Message queues\n    ├── status-tracking/        # Project status\n    └── handoff-logs/           # Agent handoff history\n```\n\n### **Storage Implementation:**\n\nLet me create the project storage system:",
