tion: https://taskmaster-pro.vercel.app\n- Staging: https://taskmaster-staging.vercel.app\n- Preview deployments for PRs\n- Custom domain: taskmaster.app (configured)\n\nEnvironment Setup:\n- Production database on Railway\n- Redis cluster for real-time features\n- Environment variables secured\n- SSL certificates configured\n\n📊 MONITORING & ALERTING:\nApplication Monitoring:\n- Vercel Analytics for performance\n- Sentry for error tracking\n- Uptime monitoring with alerts\n- Database performance monitoring\n\nAlerting Setup:\n- Slack notifications for deployments\n- Email alerts for critical errors\n- Performance degradation alerts\n- Security incident notifications\n\n🚀 DEPLOYMENT COMPLETE!\n\n✅ TaskMaster is now live at: https://taskmaster-pro.vercel.app\n\n📊 Performance Metrics:\n- Lighthouse Score: 98/100\n- Load Time: 0.8s average\n- Core Web Vitals: All green\n- Uptime: 99.9% SLA\n\n🔗 Additional URLs:\n- Staging: https://taskmaster-staging.vercel.app\n- GitHub Repo: https://github.com/user/taskmaster\n- Documentation: https://taskmaster-pro.vercel.app/docs\n\n📁 Output saved to: /dhrit/projects/taskmaster/qa/test-and-deploy-to-vercel-1735767056.json\n\n🔄 Project Status: Use 'status --projectId \"taskmaster\"' to see coordination status\n```\n\n---\n\n## **Final Project Status Check**\n\n```bash\nstatus --projectId \"taskmaster\"\n```\n\n**Expected Output:**\n```\n📊 Project Status: taskmaster\n\n🔄 Overall: completed\n📅 Created: 2025-01-01T20:00:00.000Z\n\n👥 Agent Status:\n• PAL: completed (1 outputs) - 2025-01-01T20:01:36.000Z\n• KALP: completed (1 outputs) - 2025-01-01T20:02:56.000Z\n• BANDH: completed (1 outputs) - 2025-01-01T20:04:16.000Z\n• KOSH: completed (1 outputs) - 2025-01-01T20:05:36.000Z\n• MOOL: completed (1 outputs) - 2025-01-01T20:06:56.000Z\n• ROOP: completed (1 outputs) - 2025-01-01T20:08:16.000Z\n• GATI: completed (1 outputs) - 2025-01-01T20:09:36.000Z\n• DHAR: completed (1 outputs) - 2025-01-01T20:10:56.000Z\n\n🎉 TaskMaster App Successfully De